    },
    {
      "id": "18076906043538684",
      "text": "Nenek aku ga pernah skip dzikir pagi petang — bahkan pas sakit sekalipun.\nAku pernah nanya, \"Nek, ga capek?\"\nJawabnya si",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DeO1M8bm8X6",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-08T11:31:18+0000",
      "metrics": {
