        "reposts": 1,
        "quotes": 0,
        "shares": 0
      },
      "engagement": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "18146683786572913",
      "text": "Ada satu hal soal takdir yang lama banget aku salah paham.\nAku kira \"menerima qadar\" itu artinya diam dan pasrah doang. ",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DeNYhd7mTQV",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-07T22:01:29+0000",
      "metrics": {
        "views": 176,
        "likes": 4,
        "replies": 0,
        "reposts": 1,
        "quotes": 0,
        "shares": 0
      },
      "engagement": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "17938600212383941",
      "text": "Pernah ga, niat Umroh udah di mulut — tapi hati masih ga yakin siap?\nAku lagi di situ sekarang. Tiap habis Subuh, sebelu",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DeIjiCSlHk_",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-06T01:01:28+0000",
      "metrics": {
        "views": 185,
        "likes": 4,
        "replies": 1,
        "reposts": 0,
        "quotes": 0,
        "shares": 0
      },
      "engagement": 5
    }
  ],
