    },
    {
      "id": "18167059189482262",
      "text": "Dzikir sambil macet, antri, atau masak — tapi tanpa tasbih di tangan?\nAku dulu sering skip hitungan gara-gara ga bawa ap",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DeOMAb6HAfQ",
